WEBVTT

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:02.851
"Fumba macho yako na usikilize
sauti ya maneno.

00:18:02.875 --> 00:18:05.059
Ninafahamu shairi hili kwa moyo

00:18:05.083 --> 00:18:07.917
na ningependa pia wewe ulifahamu."

00:18:09.375 --> 00:18:11.184
Ninawashukuruni nyote.

00:18:11.208 --> 00:18:14.500
(Makofi)